r of listed companies. As part of on-going disclosure and regulatory compliance, companies are required to file corporate disclosures with the BSE. The BSE India Corporate Data information products provides access to the largest repository of corporate data for India's listed companies "),d(107,"br")(108,"br"),e(109,"strong"),n(110,"Corporate Data Offerings :"),t(),d(111,"br")(112,"br"),e(113,"ul",28)(114,"li")(115,"strong"),n(116,"Corporate Announcements :"),t(),d(117,"br"),n(118," Access to regular filings done by companies on events which are likely to have impact on the company's share prices"),d(119,"br")(120,"br"),t(),e(121,"li")(122,"strong"),n(123,"Shareholder Pattern :"),t(),d(124,"br"),n(125," Periodic filings of the shareholding pattern of companies as per regulatory mandated formats. Incorporates summary and shareholding pattern of Promoter and Promoter Group, Public Shareholders, Non Promoter \u2013 Non Public Shareholders and disclosure by Trading Members (TM) holding 1% or more of the Total no. of shares."),d(126,"br")(127,"br"),t(),e(128,"li")(129,"strong"),n(130,"Financial Results :"),t(),d(131,"br"),n(132," Access to financial results submitted by listed companies as per regulatory specified formats. Standalone results as submitted by the listed companies are available."),d(133,"br")(134,"br"),t(),e(135,"li")(136,"strong"),n(137,"Corporate Actions :"),t(),d(138,"br"),n(139," Details of all corporate action events (Book closure, Record Dates, Bonus, Rights, Annual General Meeting dates, etc), declared by the listed companies available in XML format over the Internet."),d(140,"br")(141,"br"),t(),e(142,"li")(143,"strong"),n(144,"Corporate Governance :"),t(),d(145,"br"),n(146," Details of Board Composition, Committee Composition, number of board meetings, committee meetings held during the quarter, Number of Independent directorship position held by person in companies which are required to submit these reports under the Listing Regulations."),d(147,"b